-- title:
--   Step-17 certified residue list, chunk 4 (2420 residues modulo $2^{27}$)
-- statement:
--   The explicit `List ℕ` of the 2420 residues $r$ with $0\le r<2^{27}=134217728$ that form chunk 4 of 24 of the modulus-$2^{27}$ refinement of the twentyseven-branch Syracuse descent. Each listed residue satisfies $r\equiv 27\pmod{32}$, avoids every earlier exclusion list of the branch, and admits a descent certificate with exponent budget $27$: sixteen exact rows $3b_j+1=2^{a_j}b_{j+1}$ with $b_0=r$, odd $b_{j+1}$ and $\sum_{j<16}a_j\le 27$, followed by a terminal row truncated to the remaining budget whose quotient is below $r$. The list is a published computation, so that the sixteen-step chunk theorem and the refined residual can both refer to it by name instead of repeating 2420 residues in every statement.
-- source:
